  "~{0} instructions/An approximate instruction count derived from an inline cost. Keep the leading ~ (about).": "~{0} Befehle",
  "Includes the last-call-to-static bonus: the function is deleted after inlining./Explains a very large saving: this was the only remaining call to a function private to the file.": "Beinhaltet den Bonus für den letzten Aufruf einer statischen Funktion: Die Funktion wird nach dem Inlining gelöscht.",
  "(weight {0}, threshold {1})/Follows \"inlined\" or \"not inlined - too costly\". {0} is the inline weight LLVM computed for the call (can be negative) and {1} the budget it had to stay under.Both are plain integers with no unit.": "(Gewicht {0}, Schwellenwert {1})",
  "{0}: {1}/One cost contributor: {0} is its label, e.g. \"Switch lowering\", {1} a plain integer.": "{0}: {1}",
