  "(weight {0}, threshold {1})./Follows \"not inlined - too costly\". {0} is the inline weight LLVM computed for the call and {1} the budget it had to stay under.Both are plain integers with no unit.": "(Gewicht {0}, Schwellenwert {1}).",
