  "cflat: line {0} produced no IR - showing the nearest emitted line {1}/Status bar message. IR = LLVM Intermediate Representation; keep \"IR\" as-is.{0} and {1} are source line numbers.": "cflat: Zeile {0} hat keine IR erzeugt – Anzeige der nächstgelegenen ausgegebenen Zeile {1}",
